# Frontend constraints

Follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-code/SKILL.md` when editing these files.

- Nested ternaries in JSX are forbidden. Use early returns, `{cond && <X />}`, or a small component.
- `any` is forbidden (`as any` included). Narrow with a type guard or a precise type.
- No `as Type` casts for narrowing — build `value is T` guards (JSON, unknown payloads).
- No deprecated React types (`FormEvent` → `SubmitEvent` for `onSubmit`; no `keyCode` / `onKeyPress`).
- Prefer arrow functions for helpers, handlers, hooks, and exports (`const fn = (…) =>`), not `function`.
- No inline callbacks in JSX. Name handlers before `return` (`onClick={handleSave}`, never `onClick={() => …}`).
- No inline object types. Named `interface` for props/params (prefer `interface` over `type`).
- Components: `const Name: FC<NameProps> = …` (not `function Name`); exception: Next.js page/layout/route.
- Shared UI/hooks/utils/pages: follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-packages/SKILL.md` (`@bga/components` etc.).
- No hardcoded user-facing text. Follow `.cursor/skills/translations/SKILL.md`.
- Mantine only. No Tailwind.
- `'use client'` only when the file needs state, effects, or browser events.
- UI tests follow `.cursor/skills/ui-testing/SKILL.md` (roles, labels, text; no selectors).
